# --- the key: a 909 kick at zero level. It is never heard; it only tells
# the pad and the pedal when to duck, on the break's own kicks.
automate bd_level
0
track key kit=909 len=1
>16
(BD:0.75@1 BD:0.75@1 BD:0.75@1 BD:0.25@1 BD:1.5@1)x8
R:16
(BD:0.75@1 BD:0.75@1 BD:0.75@1 BD:0.25@1 BD:1.5@1)x8
R:16

# --- the place: walking alone down a right-of-way, under the lines
